      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a high-impact talking point for Senator Vance:\n\n\"This bill is not about short-term cost pressure; it is a strategic investment in the future of American energy independence. By aggressively funding high-capacity storage now, we are future-proofing the entire clean energy infrastructure against grid strain and future demand, ensuring robust, reliable growth for the next generation of green tech jobs. This policy guarantees a necessary, high-value market that will drive deep, sustainable industry leadership for years to come, not just for the first few.",
